dion#customization","content":"Compose related `Collapsible` sections inside Accordion. Give each section a stable, unique `id`.\nSee the Collapsible component documentation for more information about section anatomy, panel content, and trigger styling."},"54":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-30","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#customization","content":"Use `defaultExpandedKeys` for initial expansion, or `expandedKeys` with `onExpandedChange` for\ncontrolled state. Keys must match the section IDs; the callback receives a `Set` of expanded keys.\nBy default, only one section can stay open. Set `allowsMultipleExpanded` to keep several open.\nBoth behaviors are shown in the examples."},"55":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-31","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#customization","content":"Use `className` and `style` to customize the group container. `data-disabled` reflects the group's\ndisabled state. Customize individual headings, triggers, and panels on the composed Collapsible sections."},"56":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-32","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#keyboard","content":"Key"},"57":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-33","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#keyboard","content":"Action"},"58":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-34","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#keyboard","content":"`Tab` / `Shift + Tab`"},"59":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-35","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/accordion#keyboard","content":"Move between enabled triggers and controls in expanded panels"},"60":{"id":"/docs/components/accordion-36","page_id":"/docs/components/accordion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/co