s/components/avatar#customization","content":"Use Image native image props for responsive image sources. Choose a deterministic `figure0` through `figure14` emphasis in lists that categorize multiple entities."},"135":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-30","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#customization","content":"When an Avatar triggers an action, compose it with `Pressable` so the Avatar keeps its own shape and receives the interaction behavior directly. Use this pattern for an Avatar Button, or place it inside `MenuTrigger` for an Account Menu:"},"136":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-31","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#accessibility","content":"Give Image meaningful `alt` text when the image conveys an identity."},"137":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-32","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#accessibility","content":"Text remains available to assistive technology when no image loads."},"138":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-33","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#accessibility","content":"Use `alt=\"\"` on the Image and `aria-hidden=\"true\"` on the Avatar when the entire avatar is purely decorative."},"139":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-34","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#accessibility","content":"Give an Avatar Button or Account Menu an accessible name with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`."},"140":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-35","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#accessibility","content":"When using `Pressable`, provide an interactive role for the non-semantic Avatar child."},"141":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-36","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#best-practices","conten