s like `Modal` adopt it with end alignment and padding."],[1389,"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."],[294,"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[1391,"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1393,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1390,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[683,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[682,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[690,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[691,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[689,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1669,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1130,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[671,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[2071,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[675,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1396,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1618,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1667,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1248,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1728,"**Arrow Left / Right**"],[1303,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[887,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[886,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[1249,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[2092,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[668,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[722,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[2088,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[2087,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[673,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[2090,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1752,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[1906,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[746,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[2126,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[2121,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[2123,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[2122,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[744