h open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1730,"**Space / Enter**"],[1250,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[297,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[885,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1304,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[727,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[737,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1395,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[977,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[2105,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[2094,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[677,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[721,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1726,"**Tab**"],[296,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1247,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1302,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1666,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1664,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1665,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[1131,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected