sed."],[1659,"`align` centers the parts as well as the text, so a `Tag` eyebrow stays centered too."],[1253,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1307,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[406,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[299,"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"],[1254,"`aria-disabled` for disabled options"],[1308,"`aria-disabled` for disabled segments"],[301,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1256,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1738,"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"],[1309,"`aria-label` required on the container for screen readers"],[405,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[1083,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[300,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[1255,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[403,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[1081,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[1080,"`aria-valuenow` is omitted while indeterminate; otherwise it reflects the current value"],[402,"`aria-valuenow` is omitted while indeterminate; otherwise it reflects the current value (clamped to 0–100)"],[1082,"`aria-valuetext` and visible value text are omitted while indeterminate; otherwise `aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`)"],[404,"`aria-valuetext` and visible value text are omitted while indeterminate; otherwise `aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`) via `Intl.NumberFormat`; the same string is rendered inside the circle. Override the text with the `aria-valuetext` prop, or control formatting with `formatOptions`"],[1932,"`Box` is a polymorphic layout component that renders as any HTML element or custom component via the `as` prop. It provides consistent spacing, elevation, rounding, and self-alignment within flex